pve-k8s-manager (0.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Cluster lifecycle from the PVE UI/API: create, provision,
    surge rolling replacement, one-minor upgrades, scale,
    backup/restore, delete with orphan audit.
  * Immutable Debian node templates for Kubernetes 1.35/1.36;
    Cilium CNI; kube-vip control-plane VIP; Proxmox SDN VNets.
  * Maintainer scripts apply/remove the pve-manager
    integration points (INTEGRATION.md), idempotently.

